+# IndividualProgression.CustomTbcRaces
+#
+#        Description: (mod-worgoblin-high-elf) Custom races that start in the Draenei or Blood Elf zones (on
+#                     Outland's map, e.g. Naga, Nightborne, Eredar) count as TBC races: TbcRacesUnlockProgression and
+#                     tbcRacesStartingProgression apply to them, and they can enter their start zones before TBC.
+#
+#        Default:     1 - Enabled
+#                     0 - Disabled (only Draenei and Blood Elves are TBC races)
+#
+IndividualProgression.CustomTbcRaces = 1
+
